  ($q$sweet-potato-pie$q$, 5, $q$Pour into pie shell and bake in preheated oven for 1 hour or until firm.$q$, $q$Pour into pie shell in a pie pan and bake in preheated oven for 1 hour or until firm.$q$),
  ($q$taco-salad$q$, 1, $q$Brown ground beef and drain any fat.$q$, $q$Brown ground beef in a skillet and drain any fat.$q$),
  ($q$tangy-crisp-vegetable-and-pasta-salad$q$, 1, $q$Cook pasta according to package directions, but do not add salt to cooking water.$q$, $q$Cook pasta in a pot according to package directions, but do not add salt to cooking water.$q$),
  ($q$tomato-and-garlic-omelet$q$, 3, $q$Spray a medium pan with nonstick cooking spray and heat over medium-high heat. Pour in egg substitute.$q$, $q$Spray a medium skillet with nonstick cooking spray and heat over medium-high heat. Pour in egg substitute.$q$),
  ($q$tomato-basil-and-bean-pasta-salad$q$, 1, $q$Cook pasta according to package directions. Drain and cool.$q$, $q$Cook pasta in a pot according to package directions. Drain and cool.$q$),
  ($q$tomato-n-cheese-pasta$q$, 1, $q$Cook pasta according to package directions; drain.$q$, $q$Cook pasta in a pot according to package directions; drain.$q$),
